The fix has already been applied. Here's a summary of what was changed and why:

**Bug:** In `src/import_merge.ts`, the URL comparison `b.url === inc.url` is case-sensitive. Hostnames in URLs are case-insensitive per RFC, so `"https://example.com/a"` and `"https://EXAMPLE.com/a"` should be treated as the same URL.

**Fix:** Replaced the exact string match with a case-insensitive hostname comparison using `new URL(...).hostname.toLowerCase()`. If URL parsing fails (malformed URLs), it falls back to the original exact string match.

